Package: vpn-jumphost
Version: 0.2.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: VPN Jumphost contributors <vpn-jumphost@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: VPN jumphost: OpenConnect+ocproxy supervisor with routing SOCKS5 proxy, PAC server, and cookie management
 A single-binary VPN jumphost that connects to an F5 BIG-IP APM VPN with
 OpenConnect, exposes a routing SOCKS5 proxy with per-domain VPN-vs-direct
 routing, serves a PAC file, and manages F5 session cookies via Chromium CDP.
 Everything runs as a normal user — no sudo, no TUN device, no namespace.
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.43), openconnect, ocproxy, chromium | chromium-browser | google-chrome-stable
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/USER/vpn-jumphost
